(Japanese: '''ポケットモンスター　４コマギャグバトル''' ''Pokémon 4Koma Gag Battle'') is a four-panel gag {{pkmn|manga}} featuring Pokémon, released on October 28, 1996 and was created by Yuuki Shinichi, Tsushima Naoto and Onodera Kouji. The manga was released from {{wp|Kobunsha}} Publishing Co.

==Characters==
* {{OBP|Red|4Koma}}: the protagonist, based on {{ga|Red|the main character from Red and Blue}}
* {{OBP|Rival|4Koma}}: Red's rival, based on {{ga|Blue|the rival from Red and Blue}}

